@page "/avatar"

<PageTitle>DRYL — Avatar</PageTitle>

<div class="col fade-in" style="gap: var(--sp-7);">

    <ComponentDocHeader Slug="avatar">
        User / entity representation. Resolves an image, then initials derived
        from <code>Name</code>, then an icon, then a generic user glyph. Pair it
        with <code>DrylAvatarGroup</code> to stack collaborators with a
        <code>+N</code> overflow tile.
    </ComponentDocHeader>

